rs","sec_5":"Product condition","sec_6":"Remarks","label_color":"Color","label_smell":"Smell & taste","label_appearance":"Appearance","info_varieties":"Variedades","info_calibers":"Sizes","info_packaging":"Packaging","info_harvest":"Harvest season","info_incoterms":"Incoterms","info_certifications":"Certificaciones","info_uses":"Applications","cta_quote_wa":"Quote on WhatsApp","cta_send_email":"Send email","cta_download_pdf":"Download PDF","contact_whatsapp":"WhatsApp","contact_email":"Email","whyus_eyebrow":"Why choose us","whyus_title":"A reliable platform for demanding importers","feat1_title":"Certified quality","feat1_text":"Products with HACCP, Kosher, Organic, GLOBAL G.A.P. and Fair Trade certifications depending on destination market.","feat2_title":"Origin traceability","feat2_text":"We work with identified producers and warehouses, with control from the field to the container.","feat3_title":"International logistics","feat3_text":"Shipping from the ports of Buenos Aires, Arica, Iquique and Callao. We coordinate FOB, CIF and CFR.","feat4_title":"Direct B2B service","feat4_text":"Direct contact with our commercial team. No middlemen, response in under 24 hours.","footer_eyebrow":"Commercial contact","footer_title":"Ready for your next import?","footer_subtitle":"Tell us which product you need, volume and destination. We reply in under 24 hours with a quote and availability.","footer_offices":"Offices","footer_contact":"Contact","footer_about":"We connect the world with the richness of Latin America. B2B export of grains, pulses and seeds from Argentina, Bolivia and Peru to global markets.","footer_rights":"All rights reserved.","country_Argentina":"Argentina","country_Bolivia":"Bolivia","country_Perú":"Peru"}'::jsonb)
